// =============================================================================
// EyePresetsM5.h — StackChan-Companion
// =============================================================================
// esp32-eyes presets ported to the StackChan CoreS3 (eye area 320×160 px)
// Scale factor applied: ×2.5  (source 128×64 → 320×160)
//
// Originally generated by tools/generators/scale_presets.py, then RETOUCHED BY HAND
// (Cozmo art direction, hardware verdicts) — do NOT regenerate blindly.
// Source     : playfultechnology/esp32-eyes (AGPL-3.0)
//              luisllamasbinaburo/ESP32_Faces (AGPL-3.0)
//
// Notes:
//   - Slope_Top/Bottom are dimensionless ratios: NOT scaled
//   - Presets are written for the LEFT eye; EyeRig::mirrored flips slopes and
//     OffsetX for the right eye (and applies the global random mirror)
//   - The _Alt presets are the other eye of the asymmetric emotions
//   - EQUIDISTANCE (A2.17): OffsetX = 0 EVERYWHERE (the gap between eye
//     centres is the same for every emotion) — ONLY exception: Nervous_Alt
//     (small 50 px eye pulled toward the centre to keep the spacing)
//   - EMOTIONS_COUNT counts only the main presets (not the Alt ones)
// =============================================================================

